   "subject": "Applying compare.multi.evol.rates to non shape data?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<br>I am looking for an easy way to compare evolutionary rate among different traits, either uni- or multivariate, but non shape ones. Is there a simple way to use compare.multi.evol.rates function for such non shape traits?<br>Best<br>Vincent<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
